          "text": "The cost to rent a bus from Company $X$ is \\$950 for the first 2 hours and an additional \\$50\nper hour for each hour after the first 2 hours. If the total cost to rent the bus from Company $X$ for\n$t$ hours, where $t \\gt 2$, is \\$ 1 , 150, which equation represents this situation?"
